<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Three areas of protection</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"card-grid card-grid--3","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group card-grid card-grid--3"><!-- wp:group {"className":"card card--path","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group card card--path"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Employment Discrimination</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Discrimination in the workplace can take many forms, such as not being hired because you are gay, jokes or harassment because you are bisexual, or even being “deadnamed.” If your city has local protections, there may be an agency or commission you can contact locally. If not, you can file a report with the Ohio Civil Rights Commission.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"card card--path is-green","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group card card--path is-green"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Housing Discrimination</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If a landlord refuses to rent, show you an apartment, or suddenly raises your rent, it is possible you are a victim of discrimination. Reporting discrimination varies depending on where you live and whether LGBTQ+ people are protected under your community’s laws.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"card card--path is-blue","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group card card--path is-blue"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Public Accommodations Discrimination</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Public accommodations are things like stores, restaurants, parks and movie theaters. If your community protects LGBTQ+ people from this type of discrimination, a business establishment may not refuse you service on the grounds that you are LGBTQ+.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></section>
<!-- /wp:group -->

